 "cards": [
  {
   "dot": "cyan",
   "title": "How a tick runs",
   "items": [
    "Game.Step bumps viewGen, runs runPhases on each map, then advances the clock",
    "runPhases is a fixed array of 15 method values; a PhaseObserver may time each",
    "Most phases gate their own work on now % interval inside the body"
   ]
  },
  {
   "dot": "amber",
   "title": "Order constraints live in comments",
   "items": [
    "power before climate; medical before needs; AI before jobs; jobs before social",
    "animals before movement; incidents after animals; world after incidents; movement last",
    "Target (ADR 0001, docs/adr, uncommitted): each becomes an After/Before edge with a golden"
   ]
  },
  {
   "dot": "slate",
   "title": "Evidence",
